ative one as commentary. It is not commentary; it is the durable record.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- `docs/governance/GITHUB_CONTROL_PLANE.md:1621` reads `BADF-WP-0111`.\n- A sweep confirms no other surface carries the stale `WP-2026-0110` → my-work mapping (issue bodies, PR bodies, `work/`, `badf/demands/`, other doctrine sections).\n- No other content in that section changes; no other family's surface is touched.\n\n## Tests\nDocs-only. The existing scope guards cover the file; no new test is warranted for a one-token identifier correction, and inventing one would be the over-engineering this repo's gate exists to refuse.\n\n**Version tier:** patch (docs-only; no CHANGELOG entry — the CHANGELOG records released code, not paperwork). **Not folded into WP-2026-0112**, which is already open on this file for an unrelated reason.\n\n<!-- agent: architect -->\n",
